              "id": "40b63072-7203-3e17-8b42-670db177174b",
              "name": "resources.rules.glog-python.dom.xss.html-property-assignment",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Opengrep Finding: resources.rules.glog-python.dom.xss.html-property-assignment"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A value that is not a string literal is assigned to `.innerHTML` or `.outerHTML`. Both parse their input as HTML, so any attacker-influenced part of that value becomes script execution in the victim's session (DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting). Assign to `.textContent` instead, which never parses markup, or sanitize with DOMPurify before assigning."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "enabled": true,
                "level": "error"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A value that is not a string literal is assigned to `.innerHTML` or `.outerHTML`. Both parse their input as HTML, so any attacker-influenced part of that value becomes script execution in the victim's session (DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting). Assign to `.textContent` instead, which never parses markup, or sanitize with DOMPurify before assigning.",
                "markdown": "A value that is not a string literal is assigned to `.innerHTML` or `.outerHTML`. Both parse their input as HTML, so any attacker-influenced part of that value becomes script execution in the victim's session (DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting). Assign to `.textContent` instead, which never parses markup, or sanitize with DOMPurify before assigning.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://owasp.org/www-community/attacks/DOM_Based_XSS](https://owasp.org/www-community/attacks/DOM_Based_XSS)\n"
